---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="News – Hanh Tran"
  description="News and milestones from Hanh Tran."
  current=""
  footer="compact"
>
<main style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; box-sizing: border-box">

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 40px 0 40px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600">News</h1>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink)">

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2026</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Jul</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Pozify</strong> won 1st place in the Backyard AI track at the <a href="https://tihado.com/blogs/pozify-build-small-backyard-ai-track-win">Gradio Build Small Hackathon</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">May</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Lumen</strong> won 3rd place and the SLNG award at the <a href="https://tihado.com/blogs/tech-europe-paris-ai-hackathon-lumen-win">&#123;Tech: Europe&#125; Paris AI Hackathon</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Apr</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Posey</strong> won 1st place in the Startup Track at WELTARE Spring Sprint 1.1.4.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2025</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Dec</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Vidzly</strong> won 1st place for Creativity at the <a href="https://tihado.com/blogs/agents-mcp-hackathon-win">Agents &amp; MCP Hackathon</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Dec</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">EatAble</strong> won 3rd place at the <a href="https://tihado.com/blogs/amd-robotics-hackathon-win">AMD Open Robotics Hackathon</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Nov</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">SEKE</strong> published in <a href="https://aclanthology.org/2025.findings-emnlp.764/">Findings of EMNLP 2025</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Jun</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Associate Cloud Engineer</strong> certification earned from Google Cloud.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2024</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Sep</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">NLP Research Engineer</strong> role started at <a href="https://www.arkhn.com/">Arkhn</a>, Paris.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Sep</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Best Paper Award</strong> received at <a href="https://tpdl2024.nuk.si/">TPDL 2024</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Aug</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Generative AI for Everyone</strong> taught at <a href="https://course.vietai.org/courses/GENERATIVE-AI-FOR-EVERYONE-2024">VietAI</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Jul</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Terminology in the era of LLMs</strong> presented in seminars at the University of Coimbra and the University of Malta.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Feb</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Program Committee member</strong> appointed for <a href="https://sites.google.com/view/textgraphs2024">TextGraphs-17</a> at ACL 2024, Bangkok.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2023</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Dec</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Student Session Chair</strong> appointed for <a href="https://2024.esslli.eu/">ESSLLI 2024</a>, Leuven.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">Oct</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">Build Applications with OpenAI API</strong> taught at <a href="https://course.vietai.org/courses/build-applications-with-openai-api">VietAI</a>.</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px 20px">
<div style="flex: 0 0 48px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">May</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 320px; min-width: 0; text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600">ChatGPT/Bard for Everyone</strong> taught at <a href="https://course.vietai.org/courses/chatgpt-bard-for-everyone">VietAI</a>.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</section>

</main>
</Layout>
